<view class="page"><view class="title">按讲次维护课程学员</view><view>新增学生请先建立档案；加入名单不会产生收费记录。已锁定课次保留历史快照。</view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><picker range="{{courses}}" range-key="courseName" value="{{courseIndex}}" bindchange="pickCourse" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="card">{{courses[courseIndex].courseName || '请选择课程'}} · {{courses[courseIndex].year}} {{courses[courseIndex].termName}} ›</view></picker><picker range="{{lessons}}" range-key="label" value="{{lessonIndex}}" bindchange="pickLesson" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="card">{{lessons[lessonIndex].label || '无有效课次，请先完善排课'}} ›</view></picker><view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="studentId"><view>{{item.studentName}} · 档案 {{item.studentId}} · 报名 {{item.enrollmentId || '无'}}</view><view>第 {{item.startLesson || 1}} 至 {{item.endLesson || '末'}} 讲 · {{item.paymentStatus}}</view><button size="mini" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}">按生效讲次移出</button></view><view class="title">关联学生档案</view><input placeholder="搜索姓名或手机号" data-field="keyword" bindinput="input" value="{{keyword}}"/><button bindtap="search" disabled="{{busy}}">搜索学生</button><picker range="{{students}}" range-key="label" value="{{studentIndex}}" bindchange="pickStudent"><view class="card">{{students[studentIndex].label || '选择学生档案'}} ›</view></picker><input placeholder="关联报名编号（正常报名必填）" data-field="enrollmentId" bindinput="input" value="{{form.enrollmentId}}"/><input type="number" placeholder="开始讲次" data-field="startLesson" bindinput="input" value="{{form.startLesson}}"/><view wx:for="{{lessons}}" wx:key="lessonId" wx:if="{{item.lessonNo == form.startLesson}}">起始日期核对：{{item.classDate}}</view><input type="number" placeholder="结束讲次（可空）" data-field="endLesson" bindinput="input" value="{{form.endLesson}}"/><picker range="{{sources}}" value="{{sourceIndex}}" bindchange="pickSource"><view class="card">来源：{{sources[sourceIndex]}}</view></picker><picker range="{{payments}}" value="{{paymentIndex}}" bindchange="pickPayment"><view class="card">收费：{{payments[paymentIndex]}}</view></picker><input placeholder="增减名单原因（移出也必填）" data-field="reason" bindinput="input" value="{{form.reason}}"/><button bindtap="add" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !lessons.length}}">保存学员生效范围</button></view>
